{"id": "b7eb54a8-c412-556c-aa1d-6a48bb46048b", "name": "", "type": "TextSummary", "created_at": 1788159985318, "updated_at": 1788159985318, "ontology_valid": false, "ontology_uri": null, "version": 1, "topological_rank": 3, "valid_to": null, "metadata": {"index_fields": ["text"]}, "belongs_to_set": null, "source_pipeline": "cognify_pipeline", "source_task": "extract_graph_and_summarize", "source_node_set": null, "source_user": "default_user@example.com", "source_content_hash": "21c66c34193b927b6a66cc445be55458", "feedback_weight": 0.5, "importance_weight": 0.5, "text": "This chunk is about Cognee and its core workflow.\n\nThis chunk is about:\n- Projects: Cognee\n- People: Alice\n- Companies/Organizations: Anthropic\n- Systems/Products: litellm, Ladybug\n- Concepts/Topics: AI memory platform, persistent knowledge graph, extract-cognify-load pipeline, remember/recall/forget\n- Places: San Francisco\n\nFacts:\n- Cognee is an open-source AI memory platform that transforms raw text, files, and URLs into a persistent knowledge graph that agents can query.\n- The Cognee core workflow exposes three verbs: remember, recall, and forget.\n- The remember operation runs an extract-cognify-load pipeline that chunks inputs, extracts entities and relationships with an LLM, embeds the chunks, and stores results in a graph database and a vector store.\n- The Cognee project depends on litellm for LLM routing and on Ladybug as its default graph backend.\n- Ladybug is a lightweight, in-process graph store designed for local development.\n- Alice works at Anthropic in San Francisco and contributes to the Cognee project.\n- Recall queries traverse the Cognee knowledge graph and combine vector similarity with graph traversal so answers remain grounded in the original chunks.\n- Example recall queries such as \"who works at Anthropic\" can return Alice, \"what does Cognee depend on\" can return litellm and Ladybug, and \"where does Alice live\" can return San Francisco.", "source_chunk_id": "f29b1faa-fdfc-59d2-b894-548427794560", "summarized_in": null, "global_context_bucket_id": null}
{"id": "f29b1faa-fdfc-59d2-b894-548427794560", "name": "", "type": "DocumentChunk", "created_at": 1788159961597, "updated_at": 1788159961597, "ontology_valid": false, "ontology_uri": null, "version": 1, "topological_rank": 2, "valid_to": null, "metadata": {"index_fields": ["text"]}, "belongs_to_set": null, "source_pipeline": "cognify_pipeline", "source_task": "extract_chunks_from_documents", "source_node_set": null, "source_user": "default_user@example.com", "source_content_hash": "21c66c34193b927b6a66cc445be55458", "feedback_weight": 0.5, "importance_weight": 0.5, "text": "Cognee is an open-source AI memory platform. It transforms raw text,\nfiles, and URLs into a persistent knowledge graph that agents can query.\n\nThe core workflow has three verbs: remember (ingest data), recall (query\nthe graph), and forget (evict data). Behind the scenes, remember runs an\nextract-cognify-load pipeline: it chunks the input, extracts entities and\nrelationships with an LLM, embeds the chunks, and stores the results in\na graph database plus a vector store.\n\nFor example, Alice works at Anthropic in San Francisco. She contributes\nto the Cognee project. The Cognee project depends on litellm for LLM\nrouting and on Ladybug as its default graph backend. Ladybug is a\nlightweight, in-process graph store designed for local development.\n\nRecall queries can traverse this graph: \"who works at Anthropic\" returns\nAlice, \"what does Cognee depend on\" returns litellm and Ladybug, and\n\"where does Alice live\" returns San Francisco. Recall combines a vector\nsimilarity step with graph traversal so the answers stay grounded in the\noriginal chunks rather than being invented by the language model.\n", "chunk_size": 414, "chunk_index": 0, "cut_type": "paragraph_end", "document_id": "12336582-265f-46fa-b473-668dd5ae8b6a", "document_name": "text_21c66c34193b927b6a66cc445be55458", "truth_alignment": null, "truth_epoch": null}
{"id": "12336582-265f-46fa-b473-668dd5ae8b6a", "name": "text_21c66c34193b927b6a66cc445be55458", "type": "TextDocument", "created_at": 1788159961391, "updated_at": 1788159961391, "ontology_valid": false, "ontology_uri": null, "version": 1, "topological_rank": 1, "valid_to": null, "metadata": {"index_fields": ["name"]}, "belongs_to_set": null, "source_pipeline": "cognify_pipeline", "source_task": "classify_documents", "source_node_set": null, "source_user": "default_user@example.com", "source_content_hash": "21c66c34193b927b6a66cc445be55458", "feedback_weight": 0.5, "importance_weight": 0.5, "raw_data_location": "file:///private/var/folders/rf/cglk7s0j1yvchfdgssrnd76c0000gn/T/cognee_demo_build_s23ct46l/data/406cad82-1b46-4c5c-b6f9-1c433cbfd89b/text_21c66c34193b927b6a66cc445be55458.txt", "external_metadata": "{}", "mime_type": "text/plain"}
